 html←PrepareHtmlPageForDependencies(packageID deps canonical)
⍝ `canonical` points at the "versions" page for this major line; see `GetCanonicalLink`.
⍝ `packageID` used to be taken from the caller, where it happened to be a local variable.
 html←(⍬('Dependencies of ',packageID))HtmlHeader((GetDataTableStuff ⍬),canonical)
 html,←⊂'<h2>Dependencies of "',packageID,'"</h2>'
 html,←AddSpecialMessage ⍬
 html,←⊂H.OpenTable 2+⌈/≢¨deps
 html,←⊂'<thead>'
 html,←⊂'<tr class="my-first-th">'
 html,←{'<th>',⍵,'</th>'}¨⊆'Dependencies'
 html,←⊂'</tr>'
 html,←⊂'</thead>'
 html,←⊂'<tbody>'
 deps←MakeLinkToPackage¨deps
 html,←{'<tr><td><code>',⍵,'</code></td></tr>'}¨deps
 html,←⊂'</tbody>'
 html,←⊂'</table>'
 html,←⊆GetFooter
 html,←⊂'</body>'
 html,←⊂'</html>'
⍝Done
